 .../lib/builtins/riscv/int_mul_impl.inc       |  32 ++-
 compiler-rt/lib/builtins/riscv/restore.S      | 172 ++++++--------
 compiler-rt/lib/builtins/riscv/save.S         | 220 ++++++++----------
 4 files changed, 185 insertions(+), 240 deletions(-)
 create mode 100644 compiler-rt/lib/builtins/riscv/.clang-format-ignore

